WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.560
Imagine giving the same
message for 950 years.

2
00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:09.730
You call people night and day,
aloud, in public and in private.

3
00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:12.360
They push their fingers into their ears.

4
00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:15.160
In the end, only a few believe.

5
00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:18.210
Even your own son refuses to come aboard.

6
00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:22.690
Yet the Qur'an names a whole
chapter after this preacher, Nuh.

7
00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:27.050
So why would the Qur'an praise a
man who convinced almost no one?

8
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:30.190
In this mission, you'll
follow Nuh's story to the Ark,

9
00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:33.220
the flood, and a mountain called Judi.

10
00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:38.610
Then you'll meet Dawud, who faced Goliath
with a small force against a big army.

11
00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:44.280
Your mission: work out why the Qur'an praises
a preacher whom almost nobody followed.
